# Root .dockerignore — applies to the build context for apps/web/Dockerfile
# (invoked as `docker build -f apps/web/Dockerfile .` from the repo root).
#
# Docker only consults the .dockerignore at the BUILD CONTEXT root, so this is
# where exclusions must live. The web Dockerfile requires the monorepo root as
# its context because its COPY paths span the workspace. Keep secrets and
# machine state out of every image layer here.

# Secrets — never bake into images. Runtime config comes from the environment.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.env.local
!.env.example

# Dependencies are installed inside the image, never copied from the host.
**/node_modules

# Build outputs are produced inside the image.
**/dist
**/build
**/out
**/.output
**/.tanstack

# VCS and editor/OS cruft.
.git
.gitignore
.github
.idea
.vscode
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs and local caches.
**/*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
**/coverage
**/.cache
tmp/
temp/

# Local agent/tooling dirs (not part of the product).
.claude/
.cursor/
.code-review
.code-review.json
.pi-lens/
.pi-subagents/
.oxlintrc.json
.prettierrc.json
.agents/
